    "title": {
     "en": "The piggy bank"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Shireen has ₹150 in her piggy bank. She puts ₹100 every week for four weeks. How much does she have at the end?"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
